WEBVTT

00:09:27.396 --> 00:09:30.608
We have the power to shape the future.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.027
The solutions are simple.

00:09:34.028 --> 00:09:36.363
It's the patriarchy
that's so damn difficult.

00:09:36.363 --> 00:09:37.990
(Laughter)

00:09:38.532 --> 00:09:42.703
(Applause)

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:49.001
So let's engage five,
six or eight-year-olds

00:09:49.001 --> 00:09:51.754
on conversation around consent

00:09:51.795 --> 00:09:53.797
and bodily autonomy

00:09:53.839 --> 00:09:58.218
as a function of affirming their humanity,

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:03.223
which in turn can look like adults
having safe, healthy,